{
  "info": {
    "name": "SliceSplit Backend",
    "_postman_id": "a8f3e4d1-9b2c-4a7e-8f1d-3c2b1a9e8d7f",
    "description": "INR-first expense-splitting backend for Slice Hackathon 2.\n\nBase URL is configured via the `{{base_url}}` env var (default `http://localhost:4000`).\n\n**Auth flow**\n1. Run `Auth > Register` or `Auth > Login` — the test script auto-stores `access_token` and `refresh_token` on the active environment.\n2. All subsequent authenticated requests pick up `{{access_token}}` via the Bearer auth.\n3. When the access token expires, run `Auth > Refresh` to rotate.\n\nFolder map mirrors `src/modules/`:\n- Health\n- Auth\n- Me\n- Groups (CRUD + members)\n- Expenses (per-group, CRUD with EQUAL/EXACT/PERCENTAGE/SHARES/CONSTRAINT split)\n- Settlements (per-group)\n- Balances (per-group summary + UPI deep links)\n- Contacts (address book)\n- Receipts (async AI OCR + convert to expense, SHA-256 dedup + retry)\n- Commands (NL voice + chat → tool-use → dry-run plan → confirm)\n- Guest Splits (Owner) + Guest Splits (Public — no auth, share-token scoped)\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_prefix", "value": "/api/v1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Liveness and readiness probes. No auth.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/health/live", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["health", "live"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness (checks DB)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/health/ready", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["health", "ready"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Register, login, refresh, logout. Login + Register auto-set {{access_token}} and {{refresh_token}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  const body = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.environment.set('access_token', body.accessToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('user_id', body.user.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice\",\n  \"password\": \"sup3rs3cret\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543210\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
            "  const body = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.environment.set('access_token', body.accessToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('user_id', body.user.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"sup3rs3cret\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
            "  const body = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.environment.set('access_token', body.accessToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
